OL,3,AMillions of Ebola dollars missing with
OL,4,Astaff unpaid while virus spreads,
OL,5,Acharity says
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of millions of dollars meant
OL,8,Fto help tackle Ebola in the Democratic
OL,9,FRepublic of Congo are not reaching the
OL,10,Fintended recipients, a medical charity
OL,11,Fhas warned.
OL,13,FA report from Medecins Sans Frontieres
OL,14,F(MSF) said that while the outbreak
OL,15,Fremained "out of control", front-line
OL,16,Fworkers were going unpaid, lacked
OL,17,Fproper training and were struggling
OL,18,Fwith shortages of essential supplies.
OL,20,FIt added that in some cases ambulances
OL,21,Fhad run out of fuel.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
