OL,4,Astaff unpaid while virus spreads,
OL,5,Acharity says
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 5,400 people have died and
OL,8,F11,000 infected with Ebola in DR Congo
OL,9,Fsince the outbreak was declared in May.
